            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "`pd.date_range(start, end, freq='D')` builds a ==fixed-frequency== index",
                "Give any ==two== of `start`, `end`, `periods`",
                "`end` is ==inclusive== when given",
                "`pd.date_range('2024-01-01', periods=5, freq='W')` makes exactly **5** weekly stamps"
              ],
              "style": "dot",
              "frame": "dashed",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "2. Frequency aliases",
              "ink": "blue"
            },
            {
              "type": "table",
              "headers": [
                "Alias",
